  "screenwriter_raw": "{\n  \"pseudos\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p1\",\n      \"text\": \"A documented supply-demand imbalance and verified equipment failure converged to create a significant capacity shortfall in the Visayas grid. The system overseer, responding to the tripped unit's unexpected shutdown, initiated a data-driven escalation protocol to manage the emergency. This sequence of events underscores how a single power outage, compounding pre-existing generation shortfalls, can destabilize an entire island region.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.85,\n      \"center\": \"result-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"why-1\", \"why-2\", \"how-0\", \"how-1\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p2\",\n      \"text\": \"From the perspective of grid stability monitors, the sequence began with a verified equipment failure. The tripped unit's unexpected shutdown was a documented outage that reduced available capacity, forcing the system overseer to declare a red alert. This grid management action was a direct, traceable response to the power generation unit's failure, a crucial step in grid stabilization.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.88,\n      \"center\": \"why-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"focalized\",\n      \"focal\": \"who-0\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"how-0\", \"how-1\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p3\",\n      \"text\": \"The resulting energy deficit, exceeding 950 megawatts, was not an isolated incident but the quantified outcome of layered stressors. Verified weather-driven load stress met a pattern of infrastructure neglect, culminating in an unscheduled generation outage. The grid operator's subsequent emergency load management action was a calculated grid protection measure, a forced demand reduction to prevent wider system collapse.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.82,\n      \"center\": \"result-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"result-0\", \"why-1\", \"why-2\", \"how-0\", \"how-2\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
